{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792535940, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T22:39:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T22:40:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792536000, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T22:39:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 67183, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "請市長整理街上的交通標誌，人行道已經不大，但還是有很多根鐵桿，希望可以走在樹下，不是走在兩根鐵桿中間", "display_name": "大安代表 No.67,183", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T22:39:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15111, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "其他", "content": "西門町常有中國人士，我認為應在各處貼滿中華民國國旗，不要讓中國人欺負台灣人。自己的國土上插滿國家國旗", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.15,111", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T22:39:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32998, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "經濟", "content": "希望針對失業可以有更多輔導，很多時候要找工作，但看到資方開出來的資訊很傻眼，勞健保是福利？是義務吧！", "display_name": "士林代表 No.32,998", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T22:39:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31214, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "雨後的蟑螂海真的很嚇人，這是我在台北土生土長的人，從未見過的場面，希望整個衛生環境可以改善。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.31,214", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 15111, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.15,111", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 32998, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.32,998", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 31214, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.31,214", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 39289, "sprite_key": "deer_c